abstract: >
  This software provides a framework for generating a high-resolution land
  surface reanalysis over Europe by jointly assimilating soil moisture and
  evapotranspiration using an iterative Ensemble Smoother data assimilation
  approach. 

keywords:
  - land surface modelling
  - soil moisture
  - evapotranspiration
  - data assimilation
  - Ensemble Smoother
  - hydrology

